' 4-2 實例：員工詢問規定（Newfront 福利助理、ServiceNow IT 服務台）。把別人的 Agent 當演員讀出來。
@startuml w42-case-faq
!include <DomainStory/domainStory>
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang TC"
Person(employee, 員工)
System(agent, Agent)
System(kb, 知識庫)
Person(staff, 承辦)
Document(question, 詢問)
Document(rule, 相關條文)
Document(answer, 答覆)
Document(summary, 轉交摘要)
activity(_, employee, 提出, question, 交給, agent)
activity(_, agent, 依詢問查找, kb, 擷取出, rule)
activity(_, agent, 依, rule, 草擬, answer)
activity(_, agent, 送出, answer, 交予, employee)
activity(_, agent, 摘要無法回答的, question, 寫成, summary)
activity(_, agent, 轉交, summary, 給, staff)
activity(_, staff, 抽查, answer)
@enduml
